u/127406.html"><span>[10:18]</span>\n <p class="author">雁衡去</p>\n <p>凤隐归时</p></a></li>\n <li><a href="/shu/127399.html"><span>[10:18]</span>\n <p class="author">萧筱晗</p>\n <p>意识托管班</p></a></li>\n <li><a href="/shu/127386.html"><span>[10:18]</span>\n <p class="author">西坡道人</p>\n <p>吾师张角：从搭救白娘子开始长生</p></a></li>\n <li><a href="/shu/127367.html"><span>[10:18]</span>\n <p class="author">魔仙堡小白</p>\n <p>我有一颗破境珠，从五灵根崛起</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n <div class="box">\n <div class="title"><a href="/top/goodnum/">热门收藏</a></div>\n <div class="vote">\n <a href="/shu/93531.html">\n <span class="layui-badge">1</span>\n <img src="https://img.110txt.com/93531/1784652.jpg" alt="恶雌娇软：深陷五个兽夫修罗场">\n <p class="bookname">恶雌娇软：深陷五个兽夫修罗场</p>\n <p class="author">莲子呢</p>\n <p class="intro" style="display: -webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp: 4;-webkit-box-orient: vertical;overflow: hidden;text-overflow: ellipsis;">沈棠一觉醒来穿成了三百斤的大胖子，却拥有五个绝色兽夫。\n美艳红狐，霸道黑豹，阴郁白蛇，人鱼暴君，硬汉金鹰上将……各个宽肩窄腰大长腿，八块腹肌堪比男模！\n原主又丑又懒遭人嫌，兽夫们避如蛇蝎，她还妄图霸王</p>\n </a>\n </div>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/419.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-orange">2</span>\n <p class="bookname">遇见竹马</p>\n <p class="author">记忆火苗</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/783.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-green">3</span>\n <p class="bookname">重生之我想收房租</p>\n <p class="author">山水是名</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/269.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-blue">4</span>\n <p class="bookname">原神：优菈是我妹</p>\n <p class="author">毛毛龙小白</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/562.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-cyan">5</span>\n <p class="bookname">我在武道图书馆苟到无敌</p>\n <p class="author">木易生火</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/537.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">6</span>\n <p class="bookname">我，沙盒玩家，从聊斋世界开始</p>\n <p class="author">幽冥潜龙</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/361.html"><span